	TAD I	CURPTR
	PUTSTX 			/ PUT OUT REAL CHAR
	JMP	MRGDNA 		/ AND LOOP FOR ALL

MRGDNB,	TAD	FILENO
	SZA CLA
	JMP	MRGDNF 		/ JUMP IF MERGE TO FILE
