/ 004	WCE	23-APR-84	ELIMINATED SECOND QURX ROUTINE IN FIELD TWO
/ 003	WCE	12-APR-84	REMOVED NECESSITY FOR MENU INTERPERTER BY
/				ADDING ONCE ONLY MENU MODULE FOR FIELD FOUR
