	JMP I	SPLTX4		/ RETURN TO CALLER

/ COME HERE TO HANDLE VALIDATION ERRORS

SPLVER,	AC7776			/ SET THE AC EQUAL TO A MINUS 2
	TAD	SPLMAX		/ COMBINE WITH THE MAXIMUM DRIVE NUMBER
	SMA CLA			/ IS THIS A MULTI DRIVE SYSTEM ?
