/CALL:	JMS	RSTCUR		AC ignored and destoryed on return.
/
/		ESC 8
/
/-----------

RSTCUR,	XX			/ entry point.
	PUTCHR;	4000+ESC	/ Output escape sequence to restore cursor & attr.
		"8&177		/  ...
	JMP I	RSTCUR


/-----------
/
/ SETRV - Set screen to reverse video mode.
/
/
/ CALL:	JMS	SETRV		AC is 0 on entry & return.
/
/		ESC [ 7 m
