	*6000			/HOPEFULLY TEMPORARY			/SB
OPENER,	XX			/CALLED TO OPEN POST PROCESSOR FILES	/SB
	RDF			/NEED TO FIND WAY BACK  TO RIGHT FLD	/SB
	TAD	CIDF0		/GET BLANK FLD CHANGE INST		/SB
	DCA	OPENEX		/PLUG INTO RETURN PATH			/SB
